OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue restriction zone to be
OL,4,Aexpanded across all of Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FBluetongue restrictions are to be
OL,7,Fexpanded across the whole of Scotland
OL,8,Ffrom Saturday.
OL,10,FParts of south-west Scotland were
OL,11,Falready in a restricted zone, after
OL,12,Fcases in the region began appearing in
OL,13,FAugust. The Scottish government said
OL,14,Fthe decision will make trading more
OL,15,Fstraightforward for farmers, hauliers,
OL,16,Fand auction markets.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
