OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue restriction zone to be
OL,4,Aexpanded across all of Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FBluetongue is an insect-borne viral
OL,7,Fdisease that affects sheep and cattle
OL,8,Famong other animals. It does not affect
OL,9,Fpeople or food safety but causes a high
OL,10,Frate of death in infected sheep and
OL,11,Ffertility problems in infected cattle.
OL,13,FThe first case in Scotland was reported
OL,14,Fin early August, in a single sheep on a
OL,15,Ffarm in Dumfries and Galloway.
